@guide Both_Netherstorm
@name Netherstorm (Area 52)
@faction Both
@levels 67-70
@zone Netherstorm
@chapter Outland
@desc Area 52 and the neutral Netherstorm hubs: the manaforges, the Kirin'Var village, the Stormspire, the Eco-Domes and the Consortium. Shared by Alliance and Horde.
@next A_Shadowmoon [faction=Alliance]
@next H_Shadowmoon [faction=Horde]

fp Area 52
bind Area 52
