accept Off To Area 52 [optional] | Netherologist Coppernickels at the Netherstorm bridge.
accept Recharging the Batteries | Bot-Specialist Alley.
accept Securing the Shaleskin Shale | Boots.
accept Consortium Crystal Collection | Nether-Stalker Khay'ji.
